sequenceDiagram
  participant test as Owned-lab harness
  participant kube as Kubernetes eviction API
  participant pdb as PodDisruptionBudget
  participant pg as Patroni members
  participant disk as Node-affine PVC
  test->>kube: Cordon and drain selected worker
  kube->>pdb: Check voluntary disruption budget
  kube->>pg: Evict selected member
  pg->>pg: Promote eligible replica if primary leaves
  kube->>disk: Replacement requires original volume node
  disk-->>kube: Replacement may remain Pending
  test->>kube: Uncordon original worker
  kube->>pg: Schedule member on retained PVC
  test->>pg: Verify streaming and acknowledged writes
